      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "a2-abilities-skills-02",
        "slug": "a2-abilities-skills-well-better",
        "title": "well and better",
        "rule_summary": "Use well to describe how someone does an action; better is the comparative form.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "برای گفتن اینکه کسی کاری را چگونه انجام می‌دهد از well و برای مقایسه از better استفاده می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
